  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2902.30 Overdraft account",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2902.30 “Overdraft account” means the ATS account established by the ATS administrator for each facility where there are 2 or more affected sources, where allowances can be held by a group of affected sources.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2903.32); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20;",
